Package: gnome-font-viewer
Version: @DEB_GNOME-FONT-VIEWER_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apps.gnome.org/Fonts/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libgnome-desktop-4-2, libharfbuzz0b, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libfribidi0
Description: GNOME Fonts, a GTK4 font browser/previewer
 GNOME Font Viewer (Fonts) is a small pure-C GTK4/libadwaita app to browse and
 preview installed fonts. Runs as a plain X11 client under any window manager.
